<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Permanent yr pretax profit up 14.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Irish Permanent yr pretax profit up 14.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31,1996</p>
<p>			   (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		33.3		   vs 28.9</p>
<p> Pretax		     48.6		   vs 42.4</p>
<p>Dividend (pence)	 8.25		   vs 7.0</p>
<p>Total dividend (pence) 12.25		  vs 10.5</p>
<p>Total income	     118.6		  vs 108.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 47 million and 48 million Irish pounds.</p>
<p>Irish Permanent Plc is an Irish-based financial services group.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom + 353 1 676 9665</p>
</text>
